  "private": true,
  "description": "CardioRisk Co-Pilot frontend. Next.js 15 (App Router) + Tailwind v4 + shadcn/ui primitives. Phase 5.1 ships the brand identity + preview page; subsequent sub-phases land the component system + screens.",
